== capture (expect MO0409)
capture.mo:7:28: MO0409 the anonymous function captures random, a Random; pass random as a parameter to a named function instead.
    sizes = [4, 8].map(fn(n) random.bytes(n).size end)
                             ^
  why: An anonymous function captures read-only, but a capability or a handle is authority: captured, it lets a call that takes only data, such as map, perform an effect no signature shows (chapter 3, effects). Authority travels only as a parameter, so a named function that takes it says what it touches.
